<para id="RM0000026Y0005X" category="C" type-id="8021N" name-id="066O7-00" from="200708">
<dtccode>P0660/96</dtccode>
<dtcname>Variable Intake VSV (ACIS)</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM0000026Y0005X_01" type-id="31" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000D9O00000">
<name>Circuit Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>This circuit commands the IACV (intake air control valve) to open and close so that intake efficiency increases according to engine load. When the engine speed is 0 to 4450r/min and the throttle valve opening angle is 60° or more, current flows and the IACV closes. In other conditions, the engine control computer does not energize it, so the IACV is open.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A177155J01" width="7.106578999in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.39in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="3.03in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="2.66in"/>
<thead>
